---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import QuickFacts from "../components/QuickFacts.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
import headerImage from "../assets/images/hard-water-header.webp";

const primaryCta = site.phoneNumber && site.phoneNumber !== "PHONE_NUMBER"
  ? { href: `tel:${site.phoneNumber}`, text: `📞 ${site.phoneNumber}` }
  : { href: "/contact/", text: "📞 Call for a Free Consultation" };
---

<Layout
  title={`Hard Water Treatment in ${site.city}, ${site.stateAbbr}`}
  description={`Hard water effects in ${site.city}, ${site.stateAbbr}. ${site.city} water tests at ${site.gpgLow}–${site.gpgHigh} GPG from ${site.waterAuthority}. Learn how hard water damages appliances and how to protect your home.`}
>
  <PageHero
    breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Hard Water Explained" }]}
    heading={`Hard Water Treatment in ${site.city}, ${site.stateAbbr} | Trusted Local Specialists`}
    image={headerImage}
    primaryCta={primaryCta}
    secondaryCta={{ href: "/quote/", text: "Get a Free Water Softener Quote in Indianapolis" }}
  >
    <p slot="opening">
      <a href="/" class="brand-link">Water Softeners of {site.city}</a>
      {" "}offers hard water treatment addressing the effects of hard water on fixtures and appliances across
      {" "}{site.city} and {site.county}, such as scale removal and pipe protection. At {site.gpgLow}–{site.gpgHigh}
      {" "}GPG from {site.waterAuthority}, calcium and magnesium deposits build up on fixtures, inside appliances,
      and inside supply lines within weeks of installation. A salt-based ion exchange softener removes these
      minerals completely at the main water entry point. Free in-home water test available. Same day service.
    </p>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-header">
        <p>At {site.gpgLow}-{site.gpgHigh} GPG, {site.city} tap water carries enough dissolved calcium and magnesium to leave visible and invisible damage throughout your home over time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Appliance Damage</p>
          <p>Scale buildup inside water heaters, dishwashers, and washing machines reduces efficiency by up to 24% per U.S. Department of Energy estimates, and it can cut appliance lifespan by years in {site.gpgLabel.toLowerCase()} water areas like {site.city}.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Pipe Scale</p>
          <p>Mineral deposits narrow pipe diameter over time, reducing water pressure and increasing the risk of clogs in older {site.city} homes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-title">Skin & Hair Effects</p>
          <p>Hard water leaves skin feeling dry and hair looking dull, since mineral residue interferes with soap and shampoo rinsing cleanly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <QuickFacts />

  <section class="section" style="background: var(--color-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Visible Signs of Hard Water in {site.city}</h2>
        <p>{site.waterAuthority} data shows these five signs appear in nearly every {site.city} home on this supply. They include the following:</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="signs-list">
        <li>White, chalky spots on dishes, faucets, and shower glass</li>
        <li>Soap and shampoo that lather poorly</li>
        <li>Stiff, scratchy laundry even after washing</li>
        <li>Reduced water pressure from scale-narrowed pipes</li>
        <li>Higher water heater energy bills</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Per {site.waterAuthority}'s own reporting, these signs point to the same {site.gpgLow}-{site.gpgHigh} GPG hardness citywide — see the installation page for how a softener stops them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container final-cta">
      <h2>Stop the Damage Before It Adds Up</h2>
      <p>A properly sized softener eliminates hardness minerals before they reach your plumbing and appliances. {site.waterAuthority} reports the same {site.gpgLow}-{site.gpgHigh} GPG reading applies citywide — get a free quote to see it applied to your home.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/quote/">Get a Free Water Softener Quote in Indianapolis</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .signs-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; max-width: 640px; padding-left: 20px; }
    .card-title { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--surface-footer); margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .final-cta { text-align: center; }
    .final-cta p { max-width: 48ch; margin: 0 auto 24px; }
  </style>
</Layout>
